WEBVTT

00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:06.500
Who is the coordinator for Class 1-6?
They haven't submitted a roster.

00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:08.040
I'll go and ask!

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:12.160
Have we decided who is in charge
of prep for the 200-meter dash?

00:00:12.160 --> 00:00:13.870
No, that's still up in the air.

00:00:13.870 --> 00:00:16.870
Is nobody available during the scheduled time?

00:00:16.870 --> 00:00:18.370
Um...

00:00:18.660 --> 00:00:21.700
Koito-san, did you find the banners we used last year?

00:00:22.040 --> 00:00:25.830
Oh! I forgot. Sorry, I'll go do that right now.

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:27.370
Can you handle it alone?

00:00:27.370 --> 00:00:29.790
Yes, they're in the gym storage room, right?

00:00:33.160 --> 00:00:34.660
Um...

00:00:34.790 --> 00:00:35.620
Excuse me!

00:00:37.870 --> 00:00:41.040
You're on the Student Council, right?
Do you know where Nanami-senpai is?

00:00:41.160 --> 00:00:45.000
She's having a meeting about Sports Day
with the teachers in the staff room right now,

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:47.910
could you come by the Student Council
room a little bit later?

00:00:47.910 --> 00:00:48.870
Sure.

00:00:49.580 --> 00:00:50.410
Student Council!

00:00:50.410 --> 00:00:51.200
Yes?

00:00:51.200 --> 00:00:53.620
Is it all right if we do our practice for the relay here?

00:00:53.620 --> 00:00:55.160
Yes, that's fine.

00:00:55.370 --> 00:00:58.330
But there's no running allowed on the nearby walkway,
so be careful please.

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:02.160
I didn't realize Sports Day required so much work!

00:01:04.580 --> 00:01:06.000
Um...

00:01:06.540 --> 00:01:08.330
This seems like a good place to start looking.

00:01:14.120 --> 00:01:16.950
Now that I think about it, we've been so busy,

00:01:16.950 --> 00:01:21.540
I haven't really had a chance to see
or speak with Nanami-senpai lately.

00:01:21.950 --> 00:01:22.790
Oh.

00:01:25.120 --> 00:01:26.200
Found them!

00:01:32.250 --> 00:01:33.910
Nanami-senpai!

00:01:34.120 --> 00:01:35.080
Yuu!

00:01:36.040 --> 00:01:38.750
I see you found the banners for us, thank you.

00:01:38.750 --> 00:01:39.700
Sure.

00:01:40.250 --> 00:01:40.910
Huh?

00:01:42.500 --> 00:01:44.700
Why are you coming in?

00:02:08.790 --> 00:02:15.250
Morning rays shine through swaying branches

00:02:16.160 --> 00:02:19.120
On this road lined with trees

00:02:19.500 --> 00:02:28.750
I can hear your familiar voice saying "Good morning"

00:02:30.160 --> 00:02:33.450
Inside that locked glass box

00:02:33.450 --> 00:02:40.450
I wonder what's been hidden

00:02:40.830 --> 00:02:46.660
A tale that has begun

00:02:46.790 --> 00:02:51.290
I want to know more about your world

00:02:51.620 --> 00:02:57.410
I brushed against those fingers by chance

00:02:57.620 --> 00:03:02.000
But now I'm holding on to them

00:03:02.000 --> 00:03:05.450
Your strengths and weaknesses

00:03:05.450 --> 00:03:12.040
I'll embrace all of them

00:03:12.250 --> 00:03:18.080
Tightly

00:03:23.620 --> 00:03:26.080
Um... Senpai?

00:03:34.160 --> 00:03:35.040
Huh?

00:03:37.790 --> 00:03:39.910
What are you doing?

00:03:41.870 --> 00:03:43.160
Recharging my battery?

00:03:45.580 --> 00:03:46.500
May I?

00:03:47.450 --> 00:03:48.620
Oh, jeez...

00:03:57.200 --> 00:04:00.160
I feel like it's been forever since the last time.

00:04:00.410 --> 00:04:01.750
You're hopeless.

00:04:01.750 --> 00:04:05.410
Come on, you know we haven't found any time
to be alone together lately.

00:04:05.830 --> 00:04:07.620
Are you done yet?

00:04:09.330 --> 00:04:10.160
Not yet.

00:04:22.580 --> 00:04:24.330
That's more than enough!

00:04:25.160 --> 00:04:26.580
You've taken it too far!

00:04:26.580 --> 00:04:27.750
No way!

00:04:27.750 --> 00:04:33.040
There's still a lot we have to do!
I need to get back soon, Saeki-senpai is waiting!

00:04:33.040 --> 00:04:35.250
Wait! Then...

00:04:35.370 --> 00:04:39.500
I'll be good and behave,
so when Sports Day is over...

00:04:39.660 --> 00:04:41.660
I want a reward.

00:04:41.830 --> 00:04:44.870
"A reward"? What are you scheming?

00:04:45.290 --> 00:04:48.200
I think I want you to kiss me instead.

00:04:48.620 --> 00:04:52.120
Is that any different from when you kiss me?

00:04:52.120 --> 00:04:54.540
It is! Totally different!

00:04:56.290 --> 00:04:57.830
Well, if that's what you want.

00:04:57.830 --> 00:05:00.500
Do your best to hold out until Sports Day is over.

00:05:01.080 --> 00:05:02.040
Right!

00:05:05.450 --> 00:05:12.500
EAST TOHMI HIGH SCHOOL
SPORTS DAY

00:05:05.660 --> 00:05:12.000
And now, East Tohmi High School's
47th Annual Sports Day will begin!

00:05:12.700 --> 00:05:14.830
Everyone, please do your best!

00:05:18.200 --> 00:05:19.750
Go!

00:05:26.950 --> 00:05:28.950
Yuu can run really fast.

00:05:28.950 --> 00:05:31.000
She had a lot of practice when we were in middle school!

00:05:33.750 --> 00:05:36.500
That's it, I'm done. Thanks, guys.

00:05:36.700 --> 00:05:37.660
How did it go?

00:05:37.950 --> 00:05:40.080
I came in second, so close!

00:05:40.660 --> 00:05:41.660
What's next?

00:05:41.660 --> 00:05:44.410
We need to announce the participants
for the Swedish Relay.

00:05:44.620 --> 00:05:45.580
How's our time?

00:05:45.580 --> 00:05:47.790
So far everything has been on schedule.

00:05:47.790 --> 00:05:48.620
Okay.

00:05:48.830 --> 00:05:51.450
Was there a Swedish Relay back in middle school?

00:05:51.620 --> 00:05:52.950
We had one at my school.

00:05:52.950 --> 00:05:54.330
I'm done with supervising.

00:05:55.000 --> 00:05:56.700
Thanks for all your help out there.

00:05:57.080 --> 00:05:58.080
Akari.

00:05:58.080 --> 00:06:00.870
Huh? Are you friends with Hyuga-san?

00:06:00.870 --> 00:06:04.950
Sure am. We went to middle school together
and now we're in the same class.

00:06:05.200 --> 00:06:07.660
Well, my job is finished, so I'll be heading back now.

00:06:07.660 --> 00:06:09.080
Right, thank you.

00:06:09.540 --> 00:06:11.540
I'm going to head back to my class, too.

00:06:12.910 --> 00:06:14.700
Is your class sitting over this way too, Dojima-kun?

00:06:14.700 --> 00:06:16.290
Yeah, we're further down.

00:06:17.080 --> 00:06:18.040
I'm back.

00:06:18.540 --> 00:06:19.700
Welcome back.

00:06:19.950 --> 00:06:21.290
Yo, Kano-san.

00:06:21.290 --> 00:06:26.290
Oh, you two must know each other because
of the Student Council stage show.

00:06:26.290 --> 00:06:27.080
Yeah.

00:06:27.290 --> 00:06:28.950
How's the script coming?

00:06:30.330 --> 00:06:33.870
It's coming along, but there's one part
I'm really struggling with.

00:06:33.870 --> 00:06:37.830
Oh yeah? Well, feel free to come down
to the student council room anytime!

00:06:37.830 --> 00:06:39.830
The more ladies the better, I say!

00:06:41.950 --> 00:06:45.040
I think I'm going to change your character
into a really shallow one, Dojima-kun.

00:06:45.040 --> 00:06:46.580
What?! That's mean!

00:06:47.790 --> 00:06:51.660
Speaking of which, I wanted to get your opinion
to help me with the characters for the stage show.

00:06:51.660 --> 00:06:52.500
Huh?

00:06:52.500 --> 00:06:56.200
What kind of personality would
you say Nanami-senpai has?

00:06:56.790 --> 00:06:59.080
Nanami-senpai, eh?

00:06:59.870 --> 00:07:02.290
I think that's a question you would
be better off asking Koito-san instead.

00:07:02.290 --> 00:07:06.700
I did, but I didn't learn anything aside from
the fact that she's exactly like her reputation.

00:07:07.120 --> 00:07:08.620
Is knowing her reputation not enough?

00:07:09.000 --> 00:07:14.830
I want a flaw or something unique about her, I can't make
a character just based on her reputation alone.

00:07:15.120 --> 00:07:17.910
I don't really get the problem, but it sounds difficult.

00:07:17.910 --> 00:07:18.830
Totally.

00:07:19.250 --> 00:07:22.910
What if there's nothing more to our President
than what everyone sees on the outside?

00:07:22.910 --> 00:07:24.540
That makes things difficult.

00:07:24.540 --> 00:07:26.370
Well, that's all the advice I can offer.

00:07:27.410 --> 00:07:31.040
Maybe, the fact that nobody really knows her
is the point of her character.

00:07:31.290 --> 00:07:34.540
Interesting, I didn't think about approaching it that way.

00:07:34.540 --> 00:07:36.580
Hey, Kano-san?

00:07:34.790 --> 00:07:37.540
If that's the case then, I don't have to rewrite that part.

00:07:37.000 --> 00:07:40.910
She's been like this a lot lately. Just leave her be.

00:07:38.700 --> 00:07:39.660
Yeah, that'll work.

00:07:41.330 --> 00:07:44.330
Okay, we're taking a break. Good luck handling the rest!

00:07:44.330 --> 00:07:45.040
Sure.

00:07:50.750 --> 00:07:52.370
We've finally made it to the halfway point.

00:07:52.750 --> 00:07:55.660
It feels like we haven't had a chance to catch
our breath since prep started this morning.

00:07:55.950 --> 00:07:58.580
I'm sure our Senpai have been even busier than us.

00:07:58.910 --> 00:08:01.370
Especially since they're also participating
in a lot of the events today.

00:08:03.160 --> 00:08:06.250
Are you feeling lonely because
Nanami-senpai has no time for you?

00:08:09.750 --> 00:08:11.200
Listen here!

00:08:11.910 --> 00:08:16.290
I've told you a million times,
but I don't have any feelings for Nanami-senpai.

00:08:16.500 --> 00:08:20.290
There you go again. If you didn't have any feelings,
then you wouldn't be kissing each other.

00:08:20.290 --> 00:08:21.620
I'm telling you the truth!

00:08:25.250 --> 00:08:26.950
I don't feel anything special towards her.

00:08:28.040 --> 00:08:29.080
Because...

00:08:29.870 --> 00:08:33.080
I can't fall in love with anyone.

00:08:47.750 --> 00:08:48.790
Really?

00:08:49.790 --> 00:08:52.330
Students participating in the 200-meter dash

00:08:52.330 --> 00:08:54.450
should assemble at the main tent now.

00:08:53.910 --> 00:08:56.290
Then, you're the same as me.

00:09:01.660 --> 00:09:04.450
Really... you too, Maki-kun?

00:09:06.250 --> 00:09:11.750
When I see other people in love, I think it's
a wonderful thing and I understand it to a certain extent.

00:09:11.750 --> 00:09:14.580
However, I've never had
those feelings toward anyone, myself.

00:09:15.580 --> 00:09:19.370
It's almost like when you're watching
a film or reading a story.

00:09:19.370 --> 00:09:23.660
Yeah, that's right. It just doesn't feel
like it's part of my world.

00:09:24.040 --> 00:09:27.620
Has that ever made you feel lonely?

00:09:28.080 --> 00:09:32.950
Nope, I think it's fun. I enjoy watching
everyone from this distance.

00:09:33.950 --> 00:09:35.040
I see...

00:09:37.200 --> 00:09:38.790
Are you lonely, Koito-san?

00:09:40.580 --> 00:09:42.500
I thought I was.

00:09:43.200 --> 00:09:48.750
I thought I was weird for not being able to love.
I wanted to become like everyone else.

00:09:50.330 --> 00:09:51.910
How do you feel now?

00:09:52.790 --> 00:09:56.370
Nanami-senpai said that she wanted me to stay this way.

00:09:58.910 --> 00:10:03.870
She told me that she liked me as I was,
even though I couldn't return those feelings.

00:10:04.500 --> 00:10:06.120
Because she told me that...

00:10:07.000 --> 00:10:09.580
...I guess I don't feel lonely anymore.

00:10:12.330 --> 00:10:15.040
Thanks. I'm glad we could talk!

00:10:15.040 --> 00:10:20.410
This is the first time I've been able to talk
to someone like me, so I feel a lot better.

00:10:20.410 --> 00:10:21.330
Really?

00:10:21.700 --> 00:10:25.950
Yeah. I don't feel like I have to force myself
to fall in love with anyone now.

00:10:31.660 --> 00:10:34.830
I don't think you're quite the same as I am.

00:10:35.700 --> 00:10:37.120
The face you were just making...

00:10:37.870 --> 00:10:40.410
it was definitely the look of a lonely person.

00:10:58.330 --> 00:10:59.540
A reward...

00:11:02.290 --> 00:11:05.580
She wants me to... do it.

00:11:05.870 --> 00:11:10.830
On Your Marks

00:11:10.910 --> 00:11:15.870
The Unheard Start Signal

00:11:16.580 --> 00:11:20.580
EAST TOHMI HIGH SCHOOL
SPORTS DAY

00:11:42.410 --> 00:11:43.750
Looks like fun.

00:11:44.330 --> 00:11:46.200
Visitor seating is over this way.

00:11:48.580 --> 00:11:49.620
Good afternoon.

00:11:50.700 --> 00:11:52.200
Oh, hello there.

00:11:52.830 --> 00:11:55.000
Are you here to cheer for Hakozaki-sensei?

00:11:56.370 --> 00:12:00.660
I'm more likely to taunt her than cheer for her.
The teacher's relay is soon, right?

00:12:00.660 --> 00:12:05.000
Yes. The lunch break is about to end
and it should start right after that.

00:12:07.870 --> 00:12:09.500
I'm looking forward to it.

00:12:09.500 --> 00:12:13.450
Riko is helpless when it comes to sports,
I wonder if I'll get to see her fall flat on her butt?

00:12:13.790 --> 00:12:15.790
Is that the reason you came to watch?

00:12:15.790 --> 00:12:18.370
Yep, don't tell her I was here.

00:12:18.580 --> 00:12:20.830
Is she just bored with time to kill?

00:12:21.950 --> 00:12:26.370
Well, I have to go and prepare for
the competitive relay. Excuse me.

00:12:26.370 --> 00:12:28.040
The spectator stands are just over there.

00:12:28.330 --> 00:12:30.330
Right. Good luck out there!

00:12:31.200 --> 00:12:32.000
Touko!

00:12:34.370 --> 00:12:37.200
So, the girl she had feelings for was that one, after all.

00:12:38.290 --> 00:12:39.700
She sure is pretty, but...

00:12:41.250 --> 00:12:43.080
...seems like a handful, romantically.

00:12:46.160 --> 00:12:47.290
All right then.

00:12:50.620 --> 00:12:53.120
Okay Student Council! Let's crush the competition!

00:12:53.120 --> 00:12:54.870
Yeah!

00:12:55.370 --> 00:12:59.290
You two! We can't win unless
you go out there with more enthusiasm!

00:12:59.450 --> 00:13:03.200
I don't think we stand much of
a chance against the athletic clubs.

00:13:03.200 --> 00:13:05.080
We'll do our best, but...

00:13:05.450 --> 00:13:08.250
You can't go into a fight thinking that you've already lost!

00:13:08.620 --> 00:13:10.500
That's not exactly what we're trying to say.

00:13:10.830 --> 00:13:14.200
Why are you so pumped up about this relay, anyway?

00:13:14.370 --> 00:13:16.200
Oh, that's because...

00:13:16.200 --> 00:13:20.750
Well, well, it seems the Student Council
isn't much of a threat this year.

00:13:21.910 --> 00:13:23.830
There you are, Serizawa!

00:13:23.830 --> 00:13:26.120
Victory will be mine today.

00:13:26.120 --> 00:13:28.830
Although it won't be the first time, by a long shot.

00:13:29.330 --> 00:13:33.700
You're not the only ones who have been preparing
for today, we've been training nonstop,

00:13:33.700 --> 00:13:36.410
so don't think you'll win so easily!

00:13:36.410 --> 00:13:39.830
No, no, no, I don't think you understand just
how hard the basketball club trains.

00:13:37.040 --> 00:13:38.040
What is going on?

00:13:38.700 --> 00:13:41.540
Our Captain really hates to lose.

00:13:39.830 --> 00:13:44.370
As if! Just so you know, we have the most nimble and
quick first-years in the whole school on our team.

00:13:41.540 --> 00:13:42.750
Akari.

00:13:43.080 --> 00:13:47.200
From what I hear, she is super competitive
with Nanami-senpai, especially in gym class.

00:13:44.370 --> 00:13:48.120
If that's the best you can do to intimidate me,
you're in worse shape than I thought.

00:13:47.660 --> 00:13:50.250
Well, they look like good friends to me.

00:13:48.120 --> 00:13:52.370
Last year you just got lucky, this year will be different!

00:13:50.250 --> 00:13:52.370
Which runner are you for your team?

00:13:52.370 --> 00:13:55.080
I find that hard to believe based on what I'm seeing.

00:13:52.660 --> 00:13:54.000
The third one.

00:13:54.000 --> 00:13:55.080
I am, too!

00:13:55.080 --> 00:13:58.500
But, to be honest, I really wanted
to be the fourth runner...

00:13:58.500 --> 00:14:01.040
Are you two done yet?

00:14:02.290 --> 00:14:06.120
Oh! I get it, that one Senpai you like is running fifth.

00:14:06.120 --> 00:14:09.000
Yeah, I wanted to pass off the baton to him!

00:14:09.000 --> 00:14:11.660
Akari! Don't fraternize with the enemy!

00:14:11.660 --> 00:14:12.950
That goes for Yuu, too!

00:14:12.950 --> 00:14:13.950
Right.

00:14:13.950 --> 00:14:15.000
Okay, okay.

00:14:17.080 --> 00:14:17.830
See you later!

00:14:17.830 --> 00:14:18.870
Yeah!

00:14:23.620 --> 00:14:25.620
We're definitely going to leave them in the dust!

00:14:32.160 --> 00:14:33.000
Yuu!

00:14:34.200 --> 00:14:35.160
Do your best!

00:14:35.540 --> 00:14:36.250
Right!

00:14:36.250 --> 00:14:37.500
What about me?

00:14:37.750 --> 00:14:40.200
You're plenty fast even without my support, Akari.

00:14:40.200 --> 00:14:43.500
The next event will be the competitive relay.

00:14:45.290 --> 00:14:46.120
Ready....

00:14:52.330 --> 00:14:53.120
Yuu!

00:14:55.370 --> 00:14:57.700
It's weird, I'm kind of nervous.

00:14:59.750 --> 00:15:01.080
Sports Day isn't even a big deal.

00:15:05.040 --> 00:15:06.910
Go for it, Maki-kun!

00:15:05.370 --> 00:15:07.790
Sunrise

00:15:08.330 --> 00:15:11.540
A brand new song is born

00:15:08.830 --> 00:15:12.120
Nanami-senpai REALLY wants to win this relay.

00:15:12.410 --> 00:15:20.000
Its score reflected in the water

00:15:21.750 --> 00:15:24.500
Glowrise

00:15:22.040 --> 00:15:22.620
Here!

00:15:22.620 --> 00:15:23.500
Okay!

00:15:24.500 --> 00:15:28.450
The awakening sky

00:15:28.450 --> 00:15:38.660
A chorus of chirping birds filling the air

00:15:33.040 --> 00:15:34.500
You can do it, Koito-san!

00:15:34.750 --> 00:15:36.120
Yuu!

00:15:38.830 --> 00:15:46.700
Far off in the distance a voice calls for you

00:15:43.620 --> 00:15:44.660
Senpai!

00:15:44.910 --> 00:15:45.790
Here!

00:15:46.700 --> 00:15:52.330
Stare deep into the future

00:15:50.700 --> 00:15:52.000
Run for it!

00:15:52.540 --> 00:15:53.830
Pass them all!

00:15:52.950 --> 00:16:01.120
There is a ship that ferries billions of lives

00:16:00.000 --> 00:16:00.830
Touko...

00:16:01.120 --> 00:16:09.160
Circling around the edges of the deep, deep sky

00:16:01.830 --> 00:16:04.540
Sheesh, you're always so unfair!

00:16:08.450 --> 00:16:09.160
Here!

00:16:09.370 --> 00:16:17.950
On this planet that exudes a blue, blue light

00:16:09.870 --> 00:16:10.870
Excellent!

00:16:15.620 --> 00:16:16.870
Give it your all!

00:16:18.540 --> 00:16:29.250
We dream of tomorrow and engrave our progress as we go

00:16:30.790 --> 00:16:33.500
Sunrise

00:16:33.500 --> 00:16:37.330
A song long sought after

00:16:37.660 --> 00:16:45.450
Its score reflected in the water

00:16:47.330 --> 00:16:49.790
Glowrise

00:16:50.040 --> 00:16:53.870
The awakening sky

00:16:53.870 --> 00:17:06.000
A chorus of chirping birds heard all around

00:17:02.870 --> 00:17:06.080
Senpai! You can do it!

00:17:09.370 --> 00:17:12.330
All right! The basketball club got first!

00:17:13.200 --> 00:17:16.700
I guess we really didn't stand a chance
against the more athletic clubs.

00:17:13.540 --> 00:17:15.200
Yeah! First place!

00:17:17.160 --> 00:17:19.080
What are you doing? Let's go!

00:17:21.120 --> 00:17:23.000
Huh? Oh, yeah!

00:17:24.290 --> 00:17:25.620
So, we lost...?

00:17:27.830 --> 00:17:29.080
We did it!

00:17:29.330 --> 00:17:30.870
That was some nice running, Akari!

00:17:30.870 --> 00:17:31.750
Right back at you, Senpai!

00:17:31.750 --> 00:17:33.540
So frustrating!

00:17:33.910 --> 00:17:35.790
I thought we did really good.

00:17:36.080 --> 00:17:39.160
Getting third place with our little group
is beyond impressive!

00:17:39.160 --> 00:17:40.370
Fo' sho!

00:17:41.080 --> 00:17:44.290
You're right, everyone did a really good job.

00:17:45.330 --> 00:17:46.620
Including Yuu, too.

00:17:47.660 --> 00:17:49.790
N-nice running out there.

00:17:50.660 --> 00:17:51.540
Huh?

00:17:51.540 --> 00:17:53.450
Sorry about that, Touko!

00:17:53.700 --> 00:17:56.870
My lead on you just keeps getting bigger and bigger.

00:17:57.790 --> 00:17:59.580
Next time, you're definitely going down!

00:17:59.580 --> 00:18:00.790
There's no way, fat chance!

00:18:00.790 --> 00:18:04.120
Today you just got lucky!
Everyone in the Student Council did amazing!

00:18:04.120 --> 00:18:06.620
It's only natural, we're just too strong for everyone else!

00:18:06.620 --> 00:18:08.410
So, what are we competing in next?

00:18:15.620 --> 00:18:16.370
Yuu?

00:18:16.370 --> 00:18:17.330
Huh?

00:18:18.750 --> 00:18:19.750
Something wrong?

00:18:20.120 --> 00:18:21.040
Oh...

00:18:21.700 --> 00:18:23.750
Nothing, I'm fine.

00:18:33.540 --> 00:18:34.700
Have any idea what you want for dinner?
Ms. Last Place.

00:18:47.370 --> 00:18:48.450
Jeez!

00:18:49.450 --> 00:18:50.080
I want meat

00:18:50.160 --> 00:18:51.450
I want meat

00:18:52.080 --> 00:18:57.250
Students who have finished cleaning up, should refrain
from loitering around and return home immediately.

00:18:58.410 --> 00:19:01.500
Come on, Yuu. Hurry, hurry!

00:19:02.370 --> 00:19:04.540
What made you so eager all of a sudden?

00:19:04.540 --> 00:19:09.250
I want my reward!
I behaved for the entirety of Sports Day, didn't I?

00:19:09.250 --> 00:19:14.580
I know you said "once Sports Day is over,"
but I didn't think it would be right after it ended...

00:19:14.750 --> 00:19:17.540
Don't keep me waiting, hurry!

00:19:17.910 --> 00:19:20.910
Jeez... okay, I get it! You can do whatever you want.

00:19:23.290 --> 00:19:24.450
That's not right.

00:19:25.160 --> 00:19:29.620
This is about what you're going to do to me,
not the other way around.

00:19:29.620 --> 00:19:32.040
Oh... is that we agreed on?

00:19:54.000 --> 00:19:54.950
I shouldn't!

00:19:56.450 --> 00:19:58.250
But why shouldn't I?

00:19:59.120 --> 00:20:00.200
I don't know.

00:20:01.160 --> 00:20:06.330
But... something is telling me
this is a line I shouldn't cross. I can tell.

00:20:06.870 --> 00:20:08.040
Yuu?

00:20:11.120 --> 00:20:15.830
You know... it just feels wrong
for me to be the one who initiates.

00:20:16.910 --> 00:20:17.790
Huh?!

00:20:18.080 --> 00:20:23.580
I mean, kissing you even though I don't like you...
just feels like something I shouldn't do.

00:20:23.870 --> 00:20:25.660
But you promised!

00:20:26.870 --> 00:20:27.870
Fine...

00:20:28.410 --> 00:20:31.700
Well, I'll admit it doesn't seem
like something that you would do, but still.

00:20:33.160 --> 00:20:36.620
So, if you're going to break your promise,
then in exchange...

00:20:36.950 --> 00:20:39.410
I'm going to do whatever I want.

00:20:53.830 --> 00:20:56.410
H-hey! Senpai!

00:20:59.080 --> 00:21:03.790
S-sorry! If you're not comfortable with it, then I'll stop.

00:21:05.000 --> 00:21:06.500
No... that's not...

00:21:07.450 --> 00:21:09.160
It wasn't unpleasant or anything.

00:21:10.040 --> 00:21:14.620
Actually, if I had to describe it, I'd say... it felt good.

00:21:15.620 --> 00:21:19.870
"It felt good"? Are you serious, Yuu?

00:21:30.290 --> 00:21:33.370
The way she spreads goodwill
without expecting anything in return.

00:21:34.500 --> 00:21:36.870
The way she treats everyone so kindly.

00:21:37.250 --> 00:21:39.950
Her silky-smooth hair and long eyelashes.

00:21:41.080 --> 00:21:44.080
Her nice smell. Her soft skin.

00:21:45.910 --> 00:21:52.660
Finding comfort in those parts of her is perfectly
natural and not something considered "special".

00:21:56.040 --> 00:21:57.910
I can hear a heartbeat.

00:21:59.160 --> 00:22:01.950
But that must be hers, because it can't be mine.

00:22:03.790 --> 00:22:05.120
It's just beating...

00:22:06.910 --> 00:22:08.290
way too fast.

00:22:15.620 --> 00:22:18.450
I want to know, but I also don't

00:22:18.450 --> 00:22:22.370
I like things the way they are now (The way they are now)

00:22:23.120 --> 00:22:26.000
If you must answer "Yes" or "No"

00:22:26.000 --> 00:22:32.540
Then I hope tomorrow never ever comes

00:22:45.200 --> 00:22:52.620
That world was far away from me, or so I thought (Or so I thought)

00:22:52.620 --> 00:22:59.500
These feelings shouldn't apply to me (Shouldn't apply to me)

00:22:59.500 --> 00:23:01.410
But for you, they could be possible

00:23:01.410 --> 00:23:03.290
Showing what's actually inside my heart

00:23:03.290 --> 00:23:06.910
Because nothing will ever change it

00:23:06.910 --> 00:23:08.790
I've figured out where my heart is

00:23:08.790 --> 00:23:10.620
It's about to become pretty uncomfortable

00:23:10.620 --> 00:23:13.700
Now that the wind's flow has suddenly changed

00:23:13.870 --> 00:23:16.330
What will tomorrow become?

00:23:16.330 --> 00:23:18.080
Soon it will bloom into you

00:23:18.080 --> 00:23:21.700
Take a peek at how delicate I am inside

00:23:21.700 --> 00:23:23.620
I've got butterflies in my stomach

00:23:23.620 --> 00:23:25.450
If you found out about my feelings

00:23:25.450 --> 00:23:29.250
I wonder if you'll run away?
